-decision/free-disk-only-on-stand-repeat · Runner disk freed only for the repeated stand job — Only the `Stand checks repeated` CI job frees runner disk, with the free-disk-space action pinned to a commit; the `matrix_test` job holds no such step. · guard: test_only_stand_repeat_frees_disk
